      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "gulping down the drink",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/002_director_b0a5886c609d1f2b_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.871,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "sourceEntry": 165,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "That was nice. Another?",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/003_monica_ddc356be3688283d_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.533,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "sourceEntry": 166,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "MONICA goes to the fridge, but bends over from the waist, perpendicular to exaggerate her being too tall for the caravan.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/004_director_d4572e0676cbb74d_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.425,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "sourceEntry": 166,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You don’t need another drink.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/005_rodney_7a7e362a6be6c16b_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.347,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost 25Minute"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "sourceEntry": 167,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Rodney, I do. I have never been on a camping holiday before...",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/006_monica_bc717a60f2ff43d3_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.251,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "sourceEntry": 168,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "How many times do I have to say, this is not a camping holiday? This is a luxury caravan.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/007_rodney_b143bc2100ef23e4_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 4.412,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost 25Minute"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "sourceEntry": 168,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "Looking around",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/008_director_369b5b95769b9c42_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.685,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "sourceEntry": 168,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "An almost luxury caravan. You can’t get better than this.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/009_rodney_efc918f6ccc088a6_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.926,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost 25Minute"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "sourceEntry": 169,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "MONICA gazes around, expressionless.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/010_director_d3503e353c815e9c_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.513,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "sourceEntry": 169,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Really?",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/011_monica_978b6f1e19f7cd48_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.743,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "sourceEntry": 169,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "Pouring a drink",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/012_director_afb12e523aa6dd67_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.737,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "sourceEntry": 169,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "As I was saying, Rodney. I have never been on a camping holiday, before. Indeed, I never thought I would go on a camping holiday. But as I am here, and if I am to get through it, I have to drink. Cheers.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/013_monica_d16ac90570b7bd5e_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 15.464,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "sourceEntry": 170,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "She crawls back to her chair, bent over.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/014_director_d1dddd48eab963d5_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.427,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "sourceEntry": 170,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "bright",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/015_director_e6b4a754ab20753f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.435,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "sourceEntry": 170,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I’m sure we’re all going to have a lovely time.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/016_penny_cf645fa82a18315a_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.554,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "sourceEntry": 171,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You know very well you’ve hated every summer here. I think you only invited me to watch me suffer. The way you’ve suffered for the last four years. Friends are like that.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/017_monica_bcde121261ac36e6_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 9.938,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "sourceEntry": 172,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "No, I haven’t.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/018_penny_f3ddd4ec6a93b6a8_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.975,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "sourceEntry": 172,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "inline_stage_direction",
      "text": "Pause",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/019_director_42c82360f0c227d7_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 0.59,
      "speed": "1.5x",
      "voiceName": "Ockle Jane - Dry Wit"
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "sourceEntry": 172,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "The beach is pretty.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/020_penny_e8a4445cfb20df34_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.347,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "sourceEntry": 173,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "It’s a nudist beach! I don’t intend to take my clothes off in front of all of you, and I certainly don’t want you to take your clothes off in front of me. Anyway, I don’t go out in the sun. It’s terrible for the skin.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/021_monica_ce584da3f619a67f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 12.725,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "sourceEntry": 174,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "You can wear a hat! At least, we don’t have the children.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/022_penny_78fd28794d393c30_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 3.622,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "sourceEntry": 175,
      "speaker": "RODNEY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "That’s certainly a blessing.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/023_rodney_f195d04f34d0da7d_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.254,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Ty Frost 25Minute"
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "sourceEntry": 176,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "What have you done with them?",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/024_monica_a556f922c546a29f_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 1.44,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "sourceEntry": 177,
      "speaker": "PENNY",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "Susan’s gone to tennis camp and Eric’s at riding school.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/025_penny_94726c47e2e208fa_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 2.833,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "KYLIE - AUSTRALIAN FEMALE FRIENDLY WARM"
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "sourceEntry": 178,
      "speaker": "MONICA",
      "kind": "spoken",
      "text": "I hope my poor little darlings will be all right. I’ve never left them for this long before.",
      "src": "audio/pages/14/lines/026_monica_5bc895f895b93508_norm.mp3",
      "duration": 5.387,
      "speed": null,
      "voiceName": "Charlotte - Warm & Conversational"
    }
  ],
